	tests/unit/fixtures/oracles/p1_01.t1.bin = openjpeg T1 coefficient dump for p1_01 (COC/RGN per-component overrides); byte-perfect tier-1 oracle
	tests/unit/fixtures/oracles/p1_06.t1.bin = openjpeg T1 coefficient dump for p1_06 (16 tiles, passes ending mid-plane); pins the per-coefficient reconstruction half-bit
	tests/unit/fixtures/oracles/p1_07.t1.bin = openjpeg T1 coefficient dump for p1_07 (COC/RGN per-component overrides); byte-perfect tier-1 oracle
	tools/probe_label.zig = Probe-survivor labeller: replays accepted sniper/bolter trials, decodes the mutant through the openjpeg oracle, labels inert / changed (true false negative) / wrapper_refuses
	tools/sweep_one.zig = Conformance-sweep worker: decode+classify ONE fixture/process (decodeCleanroom); prefers committed planar .pix oracle (SWEEP_PIX) else in-process openjpeg wrapper; input via SWEEP_FIXTURE; one JSON record to stderr
	tools/tile_hist.zig = Dev diagnostic (zig build tile-hist): per-tile max_abs vs openjpeg for one fixture; with JP2Z_DUMP_T1 also a per-cblk tier-1 coefficient diff (attributes divergence to T1 vs dequant/DWT)
